{"id":"3c6838a8712c10ec","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-coherent-category-compat.md","title":"历史入口","display":"df-coherent-category — 历史入口","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-coherent-category-compat","aliases":["16-df-coherent-category-compat"],"display":"df-coherent-category — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-df-coherent-category]]"],"source":"Definition 4.5.1, p. 266 (PDF 286)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-coherent-category-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-coherent-category-compat</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-coherent-category — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a42bbee3cfe3d34\" href=\"?note=9a42bbee3cfe3d34\" title=\"16-df-coherent-category\">16-df-coherent-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.5.1, p. 266 (PDF 286)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohCat}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9a42bbee3cfe3d34\" href=\"?note=9a42bbee3cfe3d34\" title=\"16-df-coherent-category\">16-df-coherent-category</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohCat}_{df}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohCat}_{df}\\)</span> 为旧拼写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{CohCat}_{df}(\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CohCat}(\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{CohCat}_{df}(\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CohCat}(\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>正则性、稳定子对象二元并与严格初对象；不额外要求所有对象的二元余积。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 4.5.1, p. 266 (PDF 286)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-coherent-category","status":"resolved","id":"9a42bbee3cfe3d34","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-coherent-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-coherent-category","status":"resolved","id":"9a42bbee3cfe3d34","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为范畴，$\\mathrm{CohCat}$ 见 [[16-df-coherent-category]]，$\\mathrm{CohCat}_{df}$ 为旧拼写。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohCat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohCat}_{df}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coherent\\text{-}category}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{CohCat}_{df}(\\mathcal B)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{CohCat}(\\mathcal B).","display":true}],"bytes":886,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-df-coherent-category-compat|df-coherent-category — 历史入口]]"}],"outgoing":["9a42bbee3cfe3d34"]}